; Independent review of the actual-turn reflection and internal rebase.
; The Form-native review flow persists every answer before collection.
import "../form/form-stdlib/core.fk"
import "review-panel.fk"
import "review-ask.fk"

(ra-review
  "cognition/tests/session-neutral-semantic-reflection-band.fk"
  "Adversarial verification only; do not edit files. Read cognition/session-neutral-semantic-reflection.fk, its band, and observe/session-neutral-semantic-reflection-live.fk. Verify that the internal verdict is constructed only from actual arriving rows and the small rebased active dictionary. The 130000-cell lexical result is a supply/index audit only and must not participate in the internal witness. Confirm that reflection preserves every candidate without selecting a sense; repeated token arrivals are valid evidence while active entries remain unique; a newly observed locale/surface/expression scope replaces its stale candidate set while unrelated scopes are retained; exact residue addresses survive; both surface-to-address and address-to-witnessed-surface queries work; and lowercase/uppercase expression facets remain distinct without minting new concepts. Preflight and run the band: it must return exactly 32767. Run the live witness: the two internal verdicts must each be 7/7 and the active body must be unique and valid. Return PASS AS AN ACTUAL-TURN NEUTRAL REFLECTION AND INTERNAL REBASE, REVISE, or BLOCK. Locate any executable defect or overclaim and name the smallest coherent repair. Empty or unavailable panel doors, including an unauthenticated Claude door, are absence rather than votes.")
